[Unit]
Description=The Tank — daily sleep-time memory consolidation. Promotes recurring episodes to semantic facts, applies Ebbinghaus decay, smooths skill proficiency via Bayesian Beta-binomial updates, extracts co-occurrence insight edges, and prunes stale rows. The "brain's slow-wave sleep" routine.

[Service]
Type=oneshot
WorkingDirectory=/root/the tank project
ExecStart=/usr/bin/python3 -m tank_learn.scripts.consolidate --ingest-then-consolidate
Nice=10
IOSchedulingClass=best-effort
IOSchedulingPriority=7
